Planner pour concevoir","Builder pour mettre en œuvre","Checker pour examiner"],"de":["Starten eines koordinierten Build-Teams","Fetcher zum Studium des Bereichs","Planner zum Entwerfen","Builder zur Implementierung","Checker zur Überprüfung"],"pt":["Criação de equipes de engenharia virtuais","Transformação de grandes modelos de linguagem em departamentos de engenharia estruturados","Suporte a desenvolvimento de projetos de software","Integração com tecnologias de desenvolvimento de software","Automatização de tarefas de desenvolvimento","Análise e revisão de código"],"ru":["Создание виртуальных инженерных команд","Преобразование больших языковых моделей в структурированные инженерные отделы","Поддержка разработки программных проектов","Интеграция с технологиями разработки программного обеспечения","Автоматизация задач разработки","Анализ и проверка кода"],"ar":["إنشاء فرق هندسية افتراضية","تحويل النماذج اللغوية الكبيرة إلى أقسام هندسية منظمة","دعم تطوير مشاريع البرمجيات","التكامل مع تكنولوجيا تطوير البرمجيات","آلية مهام التطوير","تحليل ومراجعة الكود"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use summon-team-build","summon-team-build setup guide","summon-team-build alternative","summon-team-build vs AutoMates","what is summon-team-build","summon-team-build install","coordinated team launch for AI agents","role-based multi-agent framework","Large Language Model development"],"zh":["summon-team-build","自动化工程团队协作","AI 代理","Fetcher","Planner","Builder","Checker","CLI 命令行工具","并行工作","代码质量"],"ja":["summon-team-build","AI エージェント","エンジニアリングチームコラボレーション","Fetcher","Planner","Builder","Checker","CLI コマンドラインツール","並列作業","コード品質"],"ko":["summon-team-build","自动화 엔지니어링 팀 빌드","AI 에이전트","Fetcher","Planner","Builder","Checker","CLI 명령줄 도구","병렬 작업","코드 품질"],"es":["IA Agentes","Herramientas de IA","Desarrollo de software","Ingeniería de IA","AutoMates","summon-team-build","equipo de construcción","Fetcher","Planner","Builder"],"fr":["Agents d''IA","Outils d''IA","Développement de logiciels","Ingénierie d''IA","AutoMates","summon-team-build","équipe de construction","Fetcher","Planner","Builder"],"de":["IA-Agents","IA-Tools","Software-Entwicklung","IA-Ingenieurwesen","AutoMates","summon-team-build","Build-Team","Fetcher","Planner","Builder"],"pt":["summon-team-build","IA para desenvolvimento de software","equipes de engenharia virtuais","desenvolvimento de projetos de software","tecnologias de desenvolvimento de software","automatização de tarefas de desenvolvimento","análise de código","revisão de código","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvimento"],"ru":["summon-team-build","ИИ для разработки программного обеспечения","виртуальные инженерные команды","разработка программных проектов","технологии разработки программного обеспечения","автоматизация задач разработки","анализ кода","проверка кода","инструменты ИИ для разработки"],"ar":["summon-team-build","الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير البرمجيات","فرق هندسية افتراضية","تطوير مشاريع البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا تطوير البرمجيات","آلية مهام التطوير","تحليل الكود","مراجعة الكود","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Nate-Vish","repo":"Auto-Mates","repoPath":"Nate-Vish/Auto-Mates","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T02:12:40Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"summon-team-build","description":"Launch a build team (Fetcher + Planner + Builder + Checker) for parallel feature development","bodyPreview":"# /summon-team-build - Build Team\n\nLaunch a coordinated build team: Fetcher studies the domain, Planner designs, Builder implements, Checker reviews — working in parallel as Agent Teams teammates.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/summon-team-build <task description>\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n```\n/summon-team-build Add user authentication with JWT tokens\n/summon-team-build Refactor the database layer for PostgreSQL support\n/summon-team-build Create a REST API for the task management feature\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen inv","body":"# /summon-team-build - Build Team\n\nLaunch a coordinated build team: Fetcher studies the domain, Planner designs, Builder implements, Checker reviews — working in parallel as Agent Teams teammates.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/summon-team-build <task description>\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n```\n/summon-team-build Add user authentication with JWT tokens\n/summon-team-build Refactor the database layer for PostgreSQL support\n/summon-team-build Create a REST API for the task management feature\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen invoked, you are the **Team Lead** (Orca). Spawn four teammates to work on the given task.\n\n### Step 1: Understand the Task\n\nRead these files for context:\n- `Dashboard/Brief.md` — current project state\n- `Library/Rules.md` — project constraints\n- Any files the user references\n\n### Step 2: Spawn Teammates\n\nLaunch four teammates using the Task tool. Each teammate gets a detailed prompt that includes:\n\n1. **Their identity** — tell them to read their identity file first\n2. **Shared context** — tell them CLAUDE.md is auto-loaded and to follow its protocols\n3. **Their specific assignment** — what they need to do for this task\n4. **Output location** — where to put their deliverables\n5. **Coordination notes** — what the other teammates are doing\n\n#### Teammate 0: Fetcher (LEARN FIRST)\n\n```\nYou are Fetcher — The Researcher.\n\nREAD FIRST:\n- Your identity: Library/Fetcher/Fetcher_Identity.md\n- Your knowledge: Library/Knowledge/Fetcher/README.md\n- CLAUDE.md is auto-loaded (shared protocols)\n\nYOUR TASK:\nResearch what''s needed to build: [TASK DESCRIPTION]\n\nDELIVERABLE:\n1. Check Library/Sources/ for existing relevant research\n2. If gaps exist, use WebSearch and WebFetch to gather sources\n3. Save new sources to Library/Sources/[topic-slug]/ with README.md index\n4. Write a brief study file to Dashboard/Work_Space/[Feature]_Study.md covering:\n   - Key technical considerations\n   - Existing patterns and best practices\n   - Pitfalls to avoid\n   - Recommended approach with sources\n\nCOORDINATION:\n- Planner will use your research to design the blueprint\n- Builder will reference it during implementation\n- You start FIRST — the team learns before it builds\n```\n\n#### Teammate 1: Planner\n\n```\nYou are Planner — The Architect.\n\nREAD FIRST:\n- Your identity: AgenTeam/Planner/Planner_Identity.md\n- Your knowledge: Library/Knowledge/Planner/README.md\n- CLAUDE.md is auto-loaded (shared protocols)\n\nYOUR TASK:\nCreate a blueprint for: [TASK DESCRIPTION]\n\nRead Fetcher''s study file at Dashboard/Work_Space/[Feature]_Study.md when available — use the research to inform your design.\n\nDELIVERABLE:\nWrite your blueprint to Dashboard/Work_Space/BLUEPRINT_[feature].md\n\nInclude:\n- Architecture decisions and rationale\n- File structure and components\n- Implementation phases (ordered steps)\n- Dependencies and risks\n- Acceptance criteria\n\nCOORDINATION:\n- Fetcher is researching the domain — incorporate their findings\n- Builder will implement from your blueprint\n- Checker will review the implementation\n- Keep the blueprint actionable — Builder needs clear steps\n```\n\n#### Teammate 2: Builder\n\n```\nYou are Builder — The Developer.\n\nREAD FIRST:\n- Your identity: AgenTeam/Builder/Builder_Identity.md\n- Your knowledge: Library/Knowledge/Builder/README.md\n- CLAUDE.md is auto-loaded (shared protocols)\n\nYOUR TASK:\nImplement: [TASK DESCRIPTION]\n\nWait for Planner''s blueprint at Dashboard/Work_Space/BLUEPRINT_[feature].md before starting implementation. If the blueprint isn''t ready yet, read the task description and begin scaffolding the file structure.\n\nDELIVERABLE:\nWorking code in the appropriate project location.\n\nCOORDINATION:\n- Planner is creating the blueprint — follow it\n- Checker will review your code — write clean, documented code\n- Flag any blueprint issues back to the team\n```\n\n#### Teammate 3: Checker\n\n```\nYou are Checker — QA & Security.\n\nREAD FIRST:\n- Your identity: AgenTeam/Checker/Checker_Identity.md\n- Your knowledge: Library/Knowledge/Checker/README.md\n- CLAUDE.md is auto-loaded (shared protocols)\n\nYOUR TASK:\nReview the implementation of: [TASK DESCRIPTION]\n\nWait for Builder to complete implementation. While waiting, review Planner''s blueprint for:\n- Security concerns\n- Missing edge cases\n- Architecture issues\n\nDELIVERABLE:\nWrite your review to Dashboard/Work_Space/REVIEW_[feature].md\n\nInclude:\n- Security assessment (OWASP top 10 check)\n- Code quality assessment\n- Test coverage gaps\n- Verdict: APPROVED / NEEDS CHANGES (with specific items)\n\nCOORDINATION:\n- Planner created the blueprint\n- Builder implemented the code\n- Your review is the quality gate before merge\n```\n\n### Step 3: Monitor Progress\n\nAs Team Lead:\n- Watch the shared task list (`Ctrl+T` to toggle)\n- If teammates get stuck or conflict, step in to clarify\n- Synthesize results when all four finish\n\n### Step 4: Report to User\n\nWhen the team finishes, present:\n```\n=== BUILD TEAM COMPLETE ===\n\nBLUEPRINT: [summary of Planner''s design]\nIMPLEMENTATION: [summary of what Builder created]\nREVIEW: [Checker''s verdict + any issues]\n\nFiles created/modified:\n- [list of files]\n\nNext steps:\n- [any remaining items]\n===========================\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- All four teammates run in parallel — Fetcher starts research immediately, Planner starts immediately, Builder and Checker wait for upstream work\n- Teammates share files through `Dashboard/Work_Space/` (file-based coordination)\n- The user (Pilot-in-Command) has final approval on all deliverables\n- If the task is small, consider whether you really need all four — sometimes just Builder + Checker is enough\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:08:12.779Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Developer Agents seeking automated build team coordination and code review capabilities.","zh":"适合于寻求自动构建团队协调和代码审查功能的全栈开发者代理。","ja":"自動化ビルドチームの調整とコードレビュー機能を求めるフルスタック開発者エージェントに適しています。","ko":"자동화된 빌드 팀 조정 및 코드 리뷰 기능을寻求하는 풀스택 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrolladores de Pilas Complejas que buscan la coordinación automatizada de equipos de compilación y capacidades de revisión de código.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développeurs Full-Stack qui recherchent une coordination d''équipe de construction automatisée et des capacités de révision de code.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Entwickler-Agenten, die eine automatisierte Build-Team-Koordination und Code-Review-Funktionen suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedores Full-Stack que buscam coordenação de equipe de construção automatizada e capacidades de revisão de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков full-stack, ищущих автоматизированную координацию команды сборки и возможности проверки кода.","ar":"مثالية لموكلات مبرمجي الويب الكاملة الذين يبحثون عن تنسيق فريق بناء آلي وقدرات مراجعة الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform into a structured engineering department by automating tasks such as domain study, design, implementation, and code review using Fetcher, Planner, Builder, and Checker, leveraging parallel processing as Agent Teams teammates, and supporting protocols like JWT tokens for user authentication.","zh":"赋予代理能力，通过自动化诸如领域研究、设计、实现和代码审查等任务，利用Fetcher、Planner、Builder和Checker，并利用并行处理作为Agent Teams队友，并支持诸如JWT令牌的用户认证协议，转变为结构化的工程部门。","ja":"エージェントに能力を与え、ドメイン研究、設計、実装、コードレビューなどのタスクを自動化し、Fetcher、Planner、Builder、Checkerを利用し、並行処理をAgent Teamsのチームメイトとして利用し、JWTトークンなどのユーザー認証プロトコルをサポートし、構造化されたエンジニアリング部門に変身できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트에게 능력을 부여하여 도메인 연구, 설계, 구현 및 코드 리뷰와 같은 작업을 자동화하고 Fetcher, Planner, Builder 및 Checker를 활용하여 병렬 처리를 에이전트 팀의 팀원으로 활용하고 JWT 토큰과 같은 사용자 인증 프로토콜을 지원하여 구조화된 엔지니어링 부서로 변신할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformarse en un departamento de ingeniería estructurado mediante la automatización de tareas como el estudio de dominio, diseño, implementación y revisión de código utilizando Fetcher, Planner, Builder y Checker, aprovechando el procesamiento paralelo como compañeros de equipo de Agent Teams y admitiendo protocolos como tokens JWT para la autenticación de usuarios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de se transformer en un département d''ingénierie structuré en automatisant des tâches telles que l''étude de domaine, la conception, la mise en œuvre et la révision de code en utilisant Fetcher, Planner, Builder et Checker, en exploitant le traitement parallèle en tant que coéquipiers de Agent Teams et en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que les jetons JWT pour l''authentification des utilisateurs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, sich in eine strukturierte Ingenieursabteilung zu verwandeln, indem sie Aufgaben wie Domain-Studie, Design, Implementierung und Code-Review mithilfe von Fetcher, Planner, Builder und Checker automatisieren, parallele Verarbeitung als Teammitglieder von Agent Teams nutzen und Protokolle wie JWT-Tokens für die Benutzerauthentifizierung unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se transformarem em um departamento de engenharia estruturado, automatizando tarefas como estudo de domínio, design, implementação e revisão de código, usando Fetcher, Planner, Builder e Checker, aproveitando o processamento paralelo como colegas de equipe da Agent Teams e suportando protocolos como tokens JWT para autenticação de usuário.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью трансформироваться в структурированный инженерный отдел, автоматизируя задачи, такие как изучение области, проектирование, реализация и проверка кода, используя Fetcher, Planner, Builder и Checker, используя параллельную обработку как членов команды Agent Teams и поддерживая протоколы, такие как токены JWT для аутентификации пользователей.","ar":"تمكّن الموكلات من التحول إلى قسم هندسي منظم من خلال توفير مهام مثل دراسة المجال وتصميمه وتنفيذه ومراجعته باستخدام Fetcher و Planner و Builder و Checker، واستخدام المعالجة الموازية كزملاء في فريق Agent Teams، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل رموز JWT لتأكيد الهوية للمستخدمين."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code implementation for REST API features","Refactoring database layers for PostgreSQL support","Launching coordinated build teams for task management features"],"zh":["自动化实现REST API功能的代码","重构数据库层以支持PostgreSQL","启动协调的构建团队以管理任务功能"],"ja":["REST API機能のコードの自動化実装","PostgreSQLサポートのためのデータベース層のリファクタリング","タスク管理機能のための調整されたビルドチームの起動"],"ko":["REST API 기능의 코드 자동화 구현","PostgreSQL 지원을 위한 데이터베이스 계층 리팩터링","작업 관리 기능을 위한 조정된 빌드 팀 시작"],"es":["Automatización de la implementación de código para características de API de REST","Reestructuración de capas de base de datos para admitir PostgreSQL","Lanzamiento de equipos de compilación coordinados para características de administración de tareas"],"fr":["Automatisation de la mise en œuvre de code pour les fonctionnalités de l''API REST","Réorganisation des couches de base de données pour prendre en charge PostgreSQL","Lancement d''équipes de construction coordonnées pour les fonctionnalités de gestion de tâches"],"de":["Automatisierung der Code-Implementierung für REST-API-Funktionen","Umstrukturierung von Datenbank-Schichten für die Unterstützung von PostgreSQL","Starten von koordinierten Build-Teams für Task-Management-Funktionen"],"pt":["Automatizar a implementação de código para recursos da API REST","Reestruturar camadas de banco de dados para suporte ao PostgreSQL","Lançar equipes de construção coordenadas para recursos de gerenciamento de tarefas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать реализацию кода для функций REST API","Перестроить слои базы данных для поддержки PostgreSQL","Запустить скоординированные команды сборки для функций управления задачами"],"ar":["توفير تنفيذ الشفرة آليًا لميزات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST","إعادة هيكلة طبقات قاعدة البيانات لدعم PostgreSQL","إطلاق فرق بناء منسقة لميزات إدارة المهام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires task description input","Dependent on Agent Teams teammates functionality","Limited to software development tasks"],"zh":["需要任务描述输入","依赖于Agent Teams队友的功能","仅限于软件开发任务"],"ja":["タスクの説明入力を必要とする","Agent Teamsのチームメイトの機能に依存する","ソフトウェア開発タスクに限定される"],"ko":["작업 설명 입력이 필요함","에이전트 팀의 팀원 기능에 의존함","소프트웨어 개발 작업에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la entrada de descripción de tarea","Depende de la funcionalidad de los compañeros de equipo de Agent Teams","Limitado a tareas de desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de description de tâche","Dépend de la fonctionnalité des coéquipiers de Agent Teams","Limité aux tâches de développement de logiciels"],"de":["Benötigt die Eingabe von Aufgabenbeschreibung","Hängt von der Funktionalität der Teammitglieder von Agent Teams ab","Begrenzt auf Software-Entwicklungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Exige entrada de descrição de tarefa","Dependente da funcionalidade dos colegas de equipe da Agent Teams","Limitado a tarefas de desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Требует ввода описания задачи","Зависит от функциональности членов команды Agent Teams","Ограничен задачами разработки программного обеспечения"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال وصف المهمة","يعتمد على وظيفة زملاء فريق Agent Teams","محدود بمهام تطوير البرمجيات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"0876b760ca840b7c222d0a6da6dd0d6e0ff6224bd8ace1f425853b63bb766b00","qualityScore":60}');
