具，用于提高学术写作的质量和自然性","ja":"humanize-academic-writingは、学術的な文章の質と自然性を向上させるためのAIエージェント","ko":"humanize-academic-writing은 학술 논문 작성의 질과 자연스러움을 향상시키는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"La humanización de la escritura académica es una habilidad que utiliza herramientas de IA para mejorar la calidad y naturalidad de la escritura científica","fr":"L''humanisation de l''écriture académique est une compétence qui utilise des outils d''IA pour améliorer la qualité et la naturalité de l''écriture scientifique","de":"Die Humanisierung von wissenschaftlichem Schreiben ist eine Fähigkeit, die KI-Tools nutzt, um die Qualität und Natürlichkeit von wissenschaftlichem Schreiben zu verbessern","pt":"O que é humanize-academic-writing? É uma habilidade que ajuda a melhorar a qualidade da escrita acadêmica com ferramentas de IA.","ru":"Что такое humanize-academic-writing? Это навык, который помогает улучшить качество академической письменности с помощью ИИ Агентов.","ar":"ما هي humanize-academic-writing؟ إنها مهارة تساعد على تحسين جودة الكتابة الأكاديمية باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"features":{"en":["Revises AI-drafted text based on user research and ideas","Improves writing quality for non-native English speakers","Enhances learning of better academic writing patterns","Supports ethical use, such as revising and learning, while discouraging unethical practices like idea generation without understanding"],"zh":["改进学术写作质量","自然语言处理","原创性提高","支持非英语母语者","学习更好的学术写作模式"],"ja":["学術的な文章の質を向上させる","自然な言語処理","オリジナリティの向上","非英語の母語話者をサポート","より良い学術的な文章パターンを学ぶ"],"ko":["학술 논문 작성의 질 향상","자연 언어 처리","원创性的 향상","비영어 모국어 사용자를 지원","더 나은 학술적인 글쓰기 패턴 학습"],"es":["Revisión de textos redactados por IA basados en investigaciones y ideas propias","Mejora de la calidad de la escritura para hablantes no nativos de inglés","Aprendizaje de patrones de escritura académica de alta calidad","Uso ético de herramientas de IA para mejorar la escritura científica","Compatibilidad con investigaciones y proyectos de ciencias sociales"],"fr":["Révision de textes rédigés par l''IA basés sur des recherches et des idées personnelles","Amélioration de la qualité de l''écriture pour les non-anglophones","Apprentissage de modèles d''écriture académique de haute qualité","Utilisation éthique d''outils d''IA pour améliorer l''écriture scientifique","Compatibilité avec des recherches et des projets de sciences sociales"],"de":["Überprüfung von durch KI erstellten Texten basierend auf eigenen Forschungen und Ideen","Qualitätsverbesserung der Schreibweise für nicht-muttersprachliche Englischsprecher","Erwerb von Mustern für wissenschaftliches Schreiben hoher Qualität","Ethische Nutzung von KI-Tools zur Verbesserung des wissenschaftlichen Schreibens","Kompatibilität mit Forschungen und Projekten der Sozialwissenschaften"],"pt":["Revisão de textos gerados por IA com base em pesquisas e ideias originais","Melhoria da qualidade da escrita para não falantes nativos de inglês","Aprendizado de padrões de escrita acadêmica mais eficazes","Integração com ferramentas de IA para melhorar a produtividade","Compatibilidade com diferentes estilos de escrita acadêmica"],"ru":["Редактирование текстов, сгенерированных ИИ, на основе собственных исследований и идей","Улучшение качества письма для не носителей английского языка","Изучение более эффективных паттернов академической письменности","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами для повышения производительности","Совместимость с различными стилями академической письменности"],"ar":["مراجعة نصوص生成ها الذكاء الاصطناعي بناءً على أبحاث وأفكار أصلية","تحسين جودة الكتابة للذين لا يتحدثون الإنجليزية بطلاقة","تعلم أنماط الكتابة الأكاديمية الأكثر فعالية","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين الإنتاجية","التوافق مع مختلف أنماط الكتابة الأكاديمية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use humanize-academic-writing","what is humanize-academic-writing","humanize-academic-writing alternative","humanize-academic-writing setup guide","improve academic writing with AI","AI-assisted writing tools for social sciences"],"zh":["AI工具","学术写作","自然语言处理","原创性","非英语母语者","学术写作模式","humanize-academic-writing"],"ja":["AIエージェント","学術的な文章","自然な言語処理","オリジナリティ","非英語の母語話者","学術的な文章パターン","humanize-academic-writing"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","학술 논문 작성","자연 언어 처리","원创적인","비영어 모국어 사용자","학술적인 글쓰기 패턴","humanize-academic-writing"],"es":["herramientas de AI para escritura académica","humanización de la escritura científica","escritura asistida por IA","investigación científica","ciencias sociales","redacción de textos académicos","mejora de la calidad de la escritura","aprendizaje de patrones de escritura","uso ético de herramientas de IA"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour l''écriture académique","humanisation de l''écriture scientifique","écriture assistée par l''IA","recherche scientifique","sciences sociales","rédaction de textes académiques","amélioration de la qualité de l''écriture","apprentissage de modèles d''écriture","utilisation éthique d''outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für wissenschaftliches Schreiben","Humanisierung von wissenschaftlichem Schreiben","Schreiben mit KI-Unterstützung","wissenschaftliche Forschung","Sozialwissenschaften","Erstellung von wissenschaftlichen Texten","Qualitätsverbesserung der Schreibweise","Erwerb von Mustern für wissenschaftliches Schreiben","ethische Nutzung von KI-Tools"],"pt":["humanize-academic-writing","ferramentas de IA","escrita acadêmica","qualidade da escrita","produtividade acadêmica","IA para escrita","melhorias de texto","padrões de escrita"],"ru":["humanize-academic-writing","ИИ Агенты","академическая письменность","качество письма","производительность академической работы","ИИ для письма","улучшение текста","паттерны письма"],"ar":["humanize-academic-writing","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كتابة أكاديمية","جودة الكتابة","إنتاجية أكاديمية","الذكاء الاصطناعي للكتابة","تحسين النص","أنماط الكتابة"]}},"owner":"gustavo-ferreira03","repo":"my-career-toolbox","repoPath":"gustavo-ferreira03/my-career-toolbox","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T01:29:58Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"humanize-academic-writing","description":"Transform AI-generated academic text into natural, human-like scholarly writing for social sciences. Detects AI patterns (repetitive structures, abstract language, mechanical flow) and rewrites with authentic academic voice. Use when revising AI-drafted papers, improving writing naturalness, reducing AI detection markers, or when user mentions humanizing text, academic writing quality, or social science writing for non-native English speakers.","bodyPreview":"# Humanize Academic Writing for Social Sciences\n\n## Academic Integrity Statement\n\n**Purpose**: This skill helps researchers improve the quality and naturalness of their **own original ideas** expressed through AI-assisted writing tools.\n\n**Ethical Use**:\n- ✅ Revising AI-drafted text based on your own research and ideas\n- ✅ Improving writing quality for non-native English speakers  \n- ✅ Learning better academic writing patterns\n- ❌ Using AI to generate ideas you don''t understand\n- ❌ Submitting wo","body":"# Humanize Academic Writing for Social Sciences\n\n## Academic Integrity Statement\n\n**Purpose**: This skill helps researchers improve the quality and naturalness of their **own original ideas** expressed through AI-assisted writing tools.\n\n**Ethical Use**:\n- ✅ Revising AI-drafted text based on your own research and ideas\n- ✅ Improving writing quality for non-native English speakers  \n- ✅ Learning better academic writing patterns\n- ❌ Using AI to generate ideas you don''t understand\n- ❌ Submitting work that doesn''t represent your intellectual contribution\n\n**Principle**: The goal is authentic scholarly communication, not deception.\n\n---\n\n## Target Audience\n\nNon-native English speakers in social sciences (sociology, anthropology, political science, education, psychology) who:\n- Have original ideas and research\n- Used AI tools to draft their text\n- Need to humanize the writing style\n- Want to reduce obvious AI patterns\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- User has AI-generated draft based on their own ideas\n- Text feels \"too perfect,\" mechanical, or repetitive\n- Need to reduce AI detection markers\n- Want authentic academic voice for social science writing\n- Paragraph transitions feel robotic\n- Language is overly abstract without concrete examples\n\n---\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Analyze the Text\n\nFirst, run the AI detection analyzer to identify problematic patterns:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/ai_detector.py input.txt\n```\n\nThe analyzer identifies:\n- Repetitive sentence structures and lengths\n- Overused AI transition phrases (Moreover, Furthermore, Additionally)\n- Abstract/vague language patterns (\"various aspects\", \"in terms of\")\n- Mechanical paragraph transitions\n- Unnatural word choices for social sciences\n- Low vocabulary diversity (Type-Token Ratio)\n- Excessive passive voice\n- Consecutive sentence similarity\n\n**Output**: AI probability score + specific issues marked per paragraph\n\n### Step 2: Apply Targeted Rewriting Strategies\n\nBased on detected issues, apply these fixes:\n\n#### Strategy 1: Vary Sentence Rhythm (Fix Uniformity)\n\n**AI Pattern**: All sentences are similar length (15-20 words)\n\n**Human Fix**: Mix short (5-10), medium (15-20), and long (25-35) sentences\n\nExample:\n- AI: \"This study examines social media impact. The research focuses on young adults. The analysis considers multiple factors.\"\n- Human: \"This study examines social media''s impact on young adults, considering factors ranging from identity formation to civic engagement.\"\n\n#### Strategy 2: Reduce Abstract Scaffolding\n\n**AI Pattern**: Vague placeholder phrases that say little\n\nCommon culprits:\n- \"various aspects\"\n- \"in terms of\"\n- \"it is important to note that\"\n- \"multiple factors\"\n- \"different perspectives\"\n\n**Human Fix**: Replace with specific concepts, named theories, concrete examples\n\nExample:\n- AI: \"In terms of the various aspects of social interaction, multiple factors play important roles.\"\n- Human: \"Social interaction depends on trust, reciprocity, and shared norms—factors that vary across cultural contexts.\"\n\n#### Strategy 3: Eliminate Mechanical Transitions\n\n**AI Pattern**: Overusing formal connectors at sentence starts\n\nOverused words:\n- Moreover,\n- Furthermore,\n- Additionally,\n- In addition,\n- It is important to note that\n\n**Human Fix**: Use diverse transition strategies:\n- Direct logical flow (no connector needed)\n- \"This pattern echoes...\"\n- \"Building on this insight...\"\n- \"Yet\" / \"Still\" / \"However\" (sparingly)\n- Implicit connections through content\n\n#### Strategy 4: Add Scholarly Voice\n\n**AI Pattern**: Generic academic tone without personality or critical engagement\n\n**Human Fix**:\n- Include appropriate hedging (\"may suggest\", \"appears to\", \"potentially\")\n- Show critical engagement with sources\n- Use disciplinary language naturally\n- Demonstrate genuine intellectual grappling\n\nExample:\n- AI: \"The data shows a correlation between X and Y.\"\n- Human: \"The data suggest a correlation between X and Y, though the causal mechanism remains unclear and warrants further investigation.\"\n\n#### Strategy 5: Ground in Specificity\n\n**AI Pattern**: Generic statements without grounding\n\n**Human Fix**:\n- Name specific theories/scholars\n- Include concrete examples\n- Reference particular contexts\n- Cite actual studies with details\n\nExample:\n- AI: \"Research has shown various effects of social media on society.\"\n- Human: \"Recent ethnographic work documents how Instagram reshapes young women''s body image practices (Tiidenberg 2018), while experimental studies reveal minimal effects on political polarization (Guess et al. 2023).\"\n\n### Step 3: Rewrite with Rationale\n\nFor each paragraph, follow this format:\n\n**Original (AI-generated):**\n[Paste the original text]\n\n**Revised (Humanized):**\n[Your rewritten version]\n\n**Rationale:**\nExplain in 1-2 sentences what AI patterns you fixed. Examples:\n- \"Removed repetitive ''Moreover/Additionally'' transitions and varied sentence rhythm (added one short sentence, one long); replaced ''various aspects'' with specific concepts (trust, reciprocity, norms).\"\n- \"Eliminated abstract scaffolding (''in terms of'', ''multiple factors''); added concrete citation (Smith 2022) and specific research finding; included scholarly hedging (''suggests'' rather than ''shows'').\"\n- \"Broke uniform 18-word sentences into varied lengths (8, 24, 15 words); removed mechanical ''Furthermore'' openers; grounded claims in named theory (social capital) and specific context (urban China).\"\n\n---\n\n## Key Principles for Humanizing Text\n\n### 1. Perplexity (Unpredictability)\n- **Problem**: AI text is too predictable\n- **Fix**: Add unexpected (but academically appropriate) word choices; vary syntactic structures\n\n### 2. Burstiness (Rhythm Variation)\n- **Problem**: AI uses uniform sentence lengths\n- **Fix**: Mix short punchy sentences with longer complex ones; create natural reading rhythm\n\n### 3. Specificity over Abstraction\n- **Problem**: AI defaults to vague abstractions\n- **Fix**: Use concrete examples, specific data, named theories; ground claims in particular contexts\n\n### 4. Authentic Academic Voice\n- **Problem**: Generic formal tone without personality\n- **Fix**: Show genuine engagement with ideas; include appropriate hedging; demonstrate critical thinking\n\n### 5. Natural Flow\n- **Problem**: Mechanical transitions and paragraph connections\n- **Fix**: Let content drive connections; use implicit logic; minimize formal connectors\n\n---\n\n## Social Science Specifics\n\n### Disciplinary Language\n\n**Sociology**:\n- Key concepts: stratification, agency, habitus, capital, institutions, inequality\n- Theoretical traditions: functionalist, conflict, symbolic interactionist, practice theory\n- Common methods: ethnography, surveys, interviews, archival analysis\n\n**Anthropology**:\n- Key concepts: culture, ritual, kinship, liminality, positionality, thick description\n- More reflexive voice acceptable\n- Ethnographic detail valued\n\n**Political Science**:\n- Key concepts: institutions, power, legitimacy, governance, state capacity\n- Causal inference language\n- Hypothesis testing frameworks\n\n**Education**:\n- Key concepts: pedagogy, curriculum, equity, achievement gaps, learning outcomes\n- Mixed methods common\n- Policy relevance emphasized\n\n**Psychology (Social)**:\n- Key concepts: cognition, behavior, attitudes, interventions, mechanisms\n- Operational definitions critical\n- Experimental designs prominent\n\n### Non-Native Speaker Considerations\n\n**Common AI Crutches**:\n1. Over-reliance on intensifiers (\"very\", \"really\", \"quite\")\n2. Repetitive sentence starters\n3. Overuse of formal connectors to signal logic\n\n**Strengths to Preserve**:\n- Clear logical structure (maintain this)\n- Formal register (appropriate for academic writing)\n- Careful grammar (don''t over-casualize)\n\n**Areas to Humanize**:\n- Vary clause structures and sentence types\n- Use field-specific terminology confidently\n- Add appropriate scholarly hedging\n- Include critical engagement with sources\n- Ground abstractions in concrete examples\n\n---\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nFor detailed guidance, see:\n\n- **[docs/rewriting-principles.md](docs/rewriting-principles.md)**: Comprehensive rewriting techniques with extended examples\n- **[docs/examples.md](docs/examples.md)**: Full before/after rewrites of different section types (intro, methods, findings, discussion)\n- **[docs/social-science-patterns.md](docs/social-science-patterns.md)**: Discipline-specific conventions and terminology\n\n---\n\n## Scripts and Tools\n\n### ai_detector.py\nAnalyzes text for AI patterns and provides detailed scoring\n\n```bash\n# Basic analysis\npython scripts/ai_detector.py input.txt\n\n# Detailed output with paragraph-by-paragraph breakdown\npython scripts/ai_detector.py input.txt --detailed\n\n# JSON output for programmatic use\npython scripts/ai_detector.py input.txt --json > analysis.json\n```\n\n### text_analyzer.py\nProvides quantitative metrics on text quality\n\n```bash\n# Analyze text metrics\npython scripts/text_analyzer.py input.txt\n\n# Compare before/after versions\npython scripts/text_analyzer.py original.txt revised.txt --compare\n```\n\n**Metrics provided**:\n- Sentence length distribution and variance\n- Vocabulary diversity (Type-Token Ratio)\n- Academic word usage frequency\n- Transition word density\n- Passive voice percentage\n- Average sentence complexity\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n1. **User provides AI-generated text**: \"Can you help humanize this paragraph from my paper?\"\n\n2. **Analyze first**:\n   - Run `ai_detector.py` or manually identify patterns\n   - Note specific issues (e.g., \"repetitive sentence structure, 3x ''Moreover'', abstract language\")\n\n3. **Rewrite strategically**:\n   - Apply relevant strategies from above\n   - Maintain the user''s core ideas and arguments\n   - Preserve accurate citations and data\n\n4. **Explain changes**:\n   - Show original → revised\n   - Provide rationale explaining what AI patterns were fixed\n   - Help user learn for future writing\n\n5. **Verify improvements**:\n   - Optionally run `text_analyzer.py` to confirm metrics improved\n   - Check that meaning and accuracy preserved\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Effective Use\n\n### Do:\n- ✅ Preserve the user''s original ideas and arguments\n- ✅ Maintain citation accuracy\n- ✅ Keep the appropriate academic register\n- ✅ Focus on patterns, not just individual words\n- ✅ Explain your changes so users learn\n\n### Don''t:\n- ❌ Change the meaning or argument\n- ❌ Add information not in the original\n- ❌ Over-casualize academic language\n- ❌ Remove all formal connectors (some are needed)\n- ❌ Make text deliberately grammatically incorrect\n\n### Balance:\nAcademic writing should be:\n- **Clear but not simplistic**\n- **Formal but not robotic**\n- **Structured but not mechanical**\n- **Precise but not pedantic**\n\n---\n\n## Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n\n1. **Over-correcting**: Don''t make every sentence wildly different in length. Natural variation exists within a range.\n\n2. **Removing all connectors**: Some transitions are necessary for clarity, especially in complex arguments.\n\n3. **Adding colloquialisms**: Academic writing should remain formal; avoid casual expressions.\n\n4. **Losing precision**: Don''t sacrifice technical accuracy for \"naturalness.\"\n\n5. **Ignoring discipline**: Social science subfields have different conventions—respect them.\n\n---\n\n## Summary Checklist\n\nAfter rewriting, verify:\n\n- [ ] Sentence lengths vary (mix of short, medium, long)\n- [ ] Mechanical transitions (Moreover, Furthermore, Additionally) removed or reduced\n- [ ] Abstract placeholder phrases replaced with specific concepts\n- [ ] At least one concrete example or named theory added\n- [ ] Scholarly hedging included where appropriate\n- [ ] Original meaning and arguments preserved\n- [ ] Citations remain accurate\n- [ ] Disciplinary language sounds natural\n- [ ] Rationale provided explaining AI patterns fixed\n\n---\n\nThis skill emphasizes **authentic scholarly communication** while respecting the intellectual work of non-native English speakers using AI tools responsibly.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:14:59.057Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing to refine AI-assisted academic writing with enhanced naturalness and originality","zh":"非常适合需要完善AI辅助学术写作并提高自然性和原创性的语言代理","ja":"AIによる学術文章作成をより自然で独創的にするために、言語エージェントに最適","ko":"자연성과 독창성을 향상시킨 AI 보조 학술 작성을完善해야 하는 언어 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan perfeccionar la escritura académica asistida por IA con una mayor naturalidad y originalidad","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langue ayant besoin d''affiner l''écriture académique assistée par IA avec une plus grande naturalité et originalité","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die das akademische Schreiben mit künstlicher Intelligenz (AI) mit verbesserter Natürlichkeit und Originalität verfeinern müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que precisam aprimorar a escrita acadêmica assistida por IA com naturalidade e originalidade aprimoradas","ru":"Идеально для языковых агентов, которым необходимо усовершенствовать академическое письмо с помощью ИИ с повышенной естественностью и оригинальностью","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى تعزيز الكتابة الأكاديمية بمساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي مع طبيعية وأصالة محسنة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality, naturally expressed academic texts using AI-assisted writing tools, ensuring adherence to academic integrity standards and improving writing patterns for non-native English speakers through comprehensive content analysis and revision","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量、自然表达的学术文本的能力，利用AI辅助写作工具，确保遵守学术诚信标准，并通过全面内容分析和修订提高非英语母语者的写作模式","ja":"AIアシストされた文章作成ツールを使用して、高品質で自然に表現された学術テキストを生成するエージェントの能力を付与し、学術的誠実性の基準を遵守し、包括的なコンテンツ分析および修正を通じて、英語非母語話者の文章パターンを改善する","ko":"에이전트가 AI 보조 작성 도구를 사용하여 높은 품질의 자연적으로 표현된 학술 텍스트를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 학술誠実性 기준을 준수하며, 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석 및 수정을 통해 영어 비모국어 화자의 글쓰기 패턴을 개선","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar textos académicos de alta calidad, expresados de manera natural, utilizando herramientas de escritura asistida por IA, garantizando el cumplimiento de los estándares de integridad académica y mejorando los patrones de escritura para hablantes no nativos de inglés a través de un análisis y revisión de contenido integral","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des textes académiques de haute qualité, exprimés de manière naturelle, en utilisant des outils d''écriture assistée par IA, en garantissant le respect des normes d''intégrité académique et en améliorant les modèles d''écriture pour les non-locuteurs natifs de l''anglais grâce à une analyse et une révision de contenu complètes","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige, natürlicherweise ausgedrückte akademische Texte mit Hilfe von künstlicher Intelligenz (AI) zu generieren, die Einhaltung der akademischen Integritätsstandards sicherzustellen und die Schreibmuster für nicht-muttersprachliche Englischsprecher durch umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und -überarbeitung zu verbessern","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar textos acadêmicos de alta qualidade, expressos naturalmente, usando ferramentas de escrita assistida por IA, garantindo a adesão aos padrões de integridade acadêmica e melhorando os padrões de escrita para falantes não nativos de inglês por meio de análise e revisão abrangentes de conteúdo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать высококачественные, естественно выраженные академические тексты с помощью инструментов письма, поддерживаемых ИИ, обеспечивая соблюдение стандартов академической честности и улучшая закономерности письма для не носителей английского языка посредством всестороннего анализа и пересмотра содержания","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من生成 نصوص أكاديمية عالية الجودة وواضحة بطريقة طبيعية باستخدام أدوات الكتابة المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي، مع ضمان الالتزام بمعايير النزاهة الأكاديمية وتحسين أنماط الكتابة للأشخاص غير الناطقين باللغة الإنجليزية من خلال تحليل ومراجعة شاملة للمحتوى"},"useCases":{"en":["Refining AI-drafted academic texts for social sciences","Improving writing quality for non-native English speakers","Learning and implementing better academic writing patterns"],"zh":["改进AI草拟的社会科学学术文本","提高非英语母语者的写作质量","学习和实施更好的学术写作模式"],"ja":["AIによる社会科学の学術テキストの改善","英語非母語話者の文章の品質を向上させる","より良い学術文章パターンの学習と実施"],"ko":["AI로 작성된 사회과학 학술텍스트를 다듬는こと","영어 비모국어 화자의 글쓰기 품질을 향상시키는 것","더 나은 학술 작문 패턴을 학습하고 구현하는 것"],"es":["Perfeccionar textos académicos redactados por IA para las ciencias sociales","Mejorar la calidad de la escritura para hablantes no nativos de inglés","Aprender y aplicar mejores patrones de escritura académica"],"fr":["Affiner les textes académiques rédigés par IA pour les sciences sociales","Améliorer la qualité de l''écriture pour les non-locuteurs natifs de l''anglais","Apprendre et appliquer de meilleurs modèles d''écriture académique"],"de":["Durch künstliche Intelligenz (AI) erstellte akademische Texte für die Sozialwissenschaften verfeinern","Schreibqualität für nicht-muttersprachliche Englischsprecher verbessern","Bessere Muster für akademisches Schreiben erlernen und umsetzen"],"pt":["Aprimorar textos acadêmicos criados por IA para ciências sociais","Melhorar a qualidade da escrita para falantes não nativos de inglês","Aprender e implementar melhores padrões de escrita acadêmica"],"ru":["Усовершенствование академических текстов, созданных ИИ, для социальных наук","Улучшение качества письма для не носителей английского языка","Изучение и реализация лучших образцов академического письма"],"ar":["تعزيز النصوص الأكاديمية المdrafted من قبل الذكاء الاصطناعي للعلوم الاجتماعية","تحسين جودة الكتابة للأشخاص غير الناطقين باللغة الإنجليزية","تعلم وتطبيق أنماط أفضل من الكتابة الأكاديمية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires researcher''s original ideas and research","Not intended for generating ideas without understanding","Submission of unedited AI-generated content is prohibited"],"zh":["需要研究人员的原始想法和研究","不适用于没有理解的情况下生成想法","未经编辑的AI生成内容的提交是禁止的"],"ja":["研究者の独自のアイデアと研究が必要","理解なしにアイデアを生成するためのものではない","編集されていないAI生成コンテンツの提出は禁止"],"ko":["연구자의 원래 아이디어와 연구가 필요","이해 없이 아이디어를 생성하는 데 사용할 수 없음","편집되지 않은 AI 생성 콘텐츠의 제출은 금지"],"es":["Requiere ideas y investigaciones originales del investigador","No está destinado a generar ideas sin comprensión","La presentación de contenido generado por IA sin edición está prohibida"],"fr":["Nécessite des idées et des recherches originales du chercheur","N''est pas destiné à générer des idées sans compréhension","La soumission de contenu généré par IA sans édition est interdite"],"de":["Benötigt die ursprünglichen Ideen und Forschungsergebnisse des Forschers","Dient nicht dazu, Ideen ohne Verständnis zu generieren","Die Einreichung von unredigiertem, durch künstliche Intelligenz (AI) generiertem Inhalt ist verboten"],"pt":["Exige ideias e pesquisas originais do pesquisador","Não é destinado a gerar ideias sem compreensão","A submissão de conteúdo gerado por IA sem edição é proibida"],"ru":["Требует оригинальных идей и исследований исследователя","Не предназначен для генерации идей без понимания","Представление неотредактированного контента, сгенерированного ИИ, запрещено"],"ar":["يتطلب أفكارًا وأبحاثًا أصلية من الباحث","لا يُقصد به توليد الأفكار بدون فهم","يحظر تقديم محتوى غير محرر تم إنشاؤه بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"60d66b9f157175db9672952cd6d47df6b6a6c77379daa64496a2cc1b6821f18b","qualityScore":60}');
